    "system": {
        "id": "cheap-shot",
        "type": "path",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Activation:</strong> <span style=\"font-family: &#x27;Cosmere Dingbats&#x27;\">1</span></p><p><em>You know exactly where to strike to leave your foe reeling in pain. Some might not view it as sporting, but it certainly works.</em></p><p>Spend 1 focus to make an unarmed attack using <strong>Thievery</strong> against the Cognitive defense of an enemy of your size or smaller, raising the stakes when you do. On a hit, the target also becomes <strong>Stunned</strong> until the end of their next turn. On a hit or graze, you can also spend <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" style=\"color: #98a4f5;\" data-tooltip=\"Opportunity\" aria-label=\"Opportunity\">O</span> to steal one item on the target’s person that they aren’t holding or wielding. The exact item you can steal is up to the GM’s discretion.</p>",
            "chat": "<p><strong>Activation:</strong> <span style=\"font-family: &#x27;Cosmere Dingbats&#x27;\">1</span></p><p>Spend 1 focus to make an unarmed attack with <strong>Thievery</strong> vs. Cognitive, raising the stakes. On a hit, the target is <strong>Stunned</strong>.</p>",
            "short": "<p><strong>Activation:</strong> <span style=\"font-family: &#x27;Cosmere Dingbats&#x27;\">1</span></p><p>Spend 1 focus to make an unarmed attack using <strong>Thievery</strong> against the Cognitive defense of an enemy of your size or smaller, raising the stakes when you do. On a hit, the target also becomes <strong>Stunned</strong> until the end of their next turn. On a hit or graze, you can also spend <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" style=\"color: #98a4f5;\" data-tooltip=\"Opportunity\" aria-label=\"Opportunity\">O</span> to steal one item on the target’s person that they aren’t holding or wielding. The exact item you can steal is up to the GM’s discretion.</p>"
        },
